-CHECK_ORDER
---- 3
37
40
52
-STATEMENT CALL QUERY_VECTOR_INDEX('embeddings', 'e_hnsw_index', [0.1521,0.3021,0.5366,0.2774,0.5593,0.5589,0.1365,0.8557], 200, efs := 500) RETURN count(node.id);
